    "The candidate's run in this repository is its own report. It is not an E1 result: the benchmark has not captured it, and the K1/E1 gate is K1.4-gate's. Three fixture schedules (51 of 142 steps) are refused because K1 has no trusted non-timeout Event source (017 L-21, L-38).",
